Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.78,0:00:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So then, what should I do with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.11,0:00:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so troublesome...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.88,0:00:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.34,0:00:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.35,0:00:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think you're doing!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.84,0:00:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch that girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.12,0:00:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,All right...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.27,0:00:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What the—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.86,0:00:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.54,0:00:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.36,0:00:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.82,0:00:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Those people have nothing to do with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.29,0:00:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch quietly. I'll finish this fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.83,0:00:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.58,0:01:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Al, you're too heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.96,0:01:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you're tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.24,0:01:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were human
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.28,0:01:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and underestimated you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.75,0:01:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This time it's really gonna hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.18,0:01:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.75,0:01:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,NOOOOOOOOO!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.51,0:01:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.79,0:02:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That certainly is a terrifying power you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.98,0:02:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Until next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.21,0:02:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you all right!?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.90,0:02:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.67,0:02:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing!?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.69,0:02:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull yourself together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.74,0:02:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
